(214, 897, 87, NULL, NULL, 'Hello Pradeep Sir/Sushil Sir\r\n\r\nKnob of RF meter for plasma asher  is not working.We switched on RF meter first with the help of black switch like knob and then we increase the RF power with the help of round knob.This round knob is not working.After plasma striking I switched off RF meter by pressing OFF button and was trying to decrease RF power with the help of the round knob(by rotating it in anticlockwise direction),.But instead of decreasing ,RF power was increasing then again it decrease and again increased.RF power was varying and did not come to zero.I switched off RF meter with the help of black switch like knob.Please look into matter at the earliest.\r\nThanks\r\nAlpana', '2015-11-16 17:21:55', 2, '2015-11-20 11:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
