(517, 189, 5, NULL, NULL, 'Filament of p-poly chamber breaking frequently.\r\nwe are able to flash the new filament, the next run while switching on the filament it does not glow.\r\nThis problem has arrived after changing the shower head.', '2017-01-10 13:09:13', 2, '2017-01-19 03:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
