(520, 558, 77, NULL, NULL, 'Malfunctioning of the 2-inch CMOS FGA furnace controller is the main issue i would like to address here.\r\nI requested for the slot on 03-01-2017 and got approved by SO. The process was supposed to be executed by SO on Thursday i.e. on 05-01-2017. At the starting of process the temperature of controller has been set for 450áµ’C but during the process the temperature in the controller has been increased by 690áµ’C which is not good for the FGA process.\r\nThe Other day i.e. on 06-01-2017, the controller of the 2-inch phosphorus diffusion furnace has been shifted to the FGA and the SO has arranged Swasti Bhatia as an operator, while she was taking the boat from the furnace, the glass nose has broken and as they don\'t have spare rod, so my process has stopped. \r\nThe next day, the controller got shifted to the phosphorus furnace and some person is using optimization. \r\nThe question is, why there is no separate controller and if so, how many months it will take for the new controller to come for the system. \r\nThe other question is if there is a change in controller, why the EMT people are not informing to the SO. \r\nIf the EMT inform the SO, at least they can block the tool but there is no communication to SO from the EMT side, so that user can plan the process by seeing the slot booking system.\r\n\r\nPlease take this issue seriously at-least the other people who are planning the process in future will get some solution to this kind of problems', '2017-01-11 13:15:46', 2, '2017-01-13 11:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
