(624, 79, 152, NULL, NULL, 'On Thursday 27-April 20-17 we did run on Sio2 ultech chamber and got thickness 60nm results were in previous mail. On friday 28 April 2017 we did one more run with same recipe but this time we targeted for 100 nm by increasing the time.  But still we are getting 60nm thickness of sio2. Please have a look onto this. Its urgent. \r\n\r\n\r\nRegarding I-Poly furnace, As per discussion with you, we run last recipe mention in the log book on 27 April 2017, in which it will give the thickness of 160 nm and we targeted for 200 nm. But with SEM image we can conclude that it is forming the nanocrystal. Please have a look and troubleshoot this ASAP.', '2017-05-03 10:33:58', 2, '2018-04-18 11:36:00', 'uploads/624.jpg', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(625, 79, 74, NULL, NULL, 'On Thursday 27-April 20-17 we did run on Sio2 ultech chamber and got thickness 60nm. On Friday 28 April 2017 we did one more run with the same recipe but this time we targeted for 100 nm by increasing the time.  But still, we are getting the 60nm thickness of sio2. Please have a look onto this. It\'s urgent.', '2017-05-03 10:37:37', 2, '2017-05-26 11:36:00', '', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(626, 79, 152, NULL, NULL, 'Regarding I-Poly furnace, As per discussion with Narayan Rao Sir, we run last recipe mention in the log book on 27 April 2017, in which it will give the thickness of 160 nm and we targeted for 200 nm. But with SEM image it is forming the nanocrystal. Please have a look and troubleshoot this ASAP. \r\n\r\nAlso this tool does not have any baseline recipe and tool is not tested frequently. Last time tool was used in 2015.', '2017-05-03 10:39:56', 2, '2018-04-18 11:36:00', 'uploads/626.jpg', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL),
