(793, 558, 82, NULL, NULL, 'Subject: Malfunctioning of the stepper motor for target change\\r\\n\\r\\nDear sir,\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease replace the stepper motor for changing target. During deposition if we want to change to other metal the target is getting stuck inside so we need to open the chamber again which may lead to formation of oxide and it will increase the contact resistance.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease look into this issue ASAP\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks and regards\\r\\nPremsai\\r\\n', '2017-12-21 10:56:09', 2, '2018-01-12 11:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
