(800, 558, 82, NULL, NULL, 'Dear sir,\\r\\n\\r\\nIssue: The Target changing from one crucible liner to another crucible liner during deposition of two or three metals\\r\\n\\r\\nThe target change in this system was very unpredictable. sometimes it will work and sometimes it won\\\'t.\\r\\nI request the EMT team to change the new stepper motor or provide some manual provision to change the target so that the users no need to break the vacuum.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease do the needful ASAP\\r\\n\\r\\nThanks and regards\\r\\nPremsai\\r\\n\\r\\n', '2018-01-14 10:28:32', 2, '2018-02-28 12:15:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
