(815, 89, 190, NULL, NULL, 'Issue reported by HiteshL,\\r\\nWe\\\'re trying to pattern sharp features means pattern edges should be straight,  optimization done with varying different energy dose Vs bake time Vs bake temperature but edge roughness still there even masks and wafer surface is cleaned\\r\\n\\r\\nAnother point is how to ensure \\WEC\\ is working or not as this also may cause rough edges issues.', '2018-02-14 10:32:03', 2, '2018-03-14 11:32:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
