(831, 1263, 82, NULL, NULL, 'Problem: Malfunctioning of the target changing motor in 4 target e-beam evaporator\\r\\n\\r\\nDear Sir/Madam,\\r\\n                            On 6th March I did a deposition of Ti/Al/Ni/Au ( 20/100/40/50 ), but when I unloaded the sample the color of the top most layer was white. So the final layer was either Ni or Ti. But when I changed the target from 1 to 2, 2 to 3 and from 3 to 4, every time the indicator has shown proper changing of the target. This may be due to the problem of the target changing motor, the targets are not rotating properly. Because of this problem 3 of my samples are wasted.\\r\\n                           I will be really grateful if you kindly look into this matter and resolve the problem associated with this tool.\\r\\n', '2018-03-08 10:32:55', 2, '2018-03-14 11:29:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(832, 1360, 123, NULL, NULL, 'Subject:frequent shut down of Semiconductor characterization System during measurements\\r\\nDear Sir/Madam,\\r\\nWhile doing measurements we where facing problem of frequent shut down of Semiconductor characterization System along with the computer during measurements. So I would like to request you to resolve the problem as soon as possible.\\r\\nThanking you,\\r\\nbest regards\\r\\nBasavaraj S S\\r\\nINUP user', '2018-03-09 11:23:39', 2, '2018-03-14 11:27:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(838, 1263, 82, NULL, NULL, 'Problem: Unsuccessful deposition of Ti on 12th March 2018\\r\\n\\r\\nTitanium was deposited on GaN template on 12th March 2018 by using 4 target e-beam evaporator. But, when the titanium coated template was being sonicated using TCE as a part of sample cleaning, titanium coating started to get etched off. So, conclusively titanium deposition was not successful.', '2018-03-15 13:00:58', 2, '2018-03-21 10:40:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(839, 89, 82, NULL, NULL, 'Issue reported by Souvik Dutta	:\\r\\n\\r\\nProblem: Unsuccessful deposition of Ti on 12th March 2018\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nTitanium was deposited on GaN template on 12th March 2018 by using 4 target e-beam evaporator. But, when the titanium coated template was being sonicated using TCE as a part of sample cleaning, titanium coating started to get etched off. So, conclusively titanium deposition was not successful.', '2018-03-21 10:32:17', 2, '2018-05-09 09:13:00', '', 4, NULL, NULL, NULL),
