(854, 938, 89, NULL, NULL, 'I poured two times liquid nitrogen but still HIVAC was not reached 10^-6 order, it was showing till 5.4E-5 after 1.5 hour. So deposition was not done. \\r\\nI have done Raith before doing this process so, please take the necessary action as soon as possible, otherwise all the sample will be wasted.', '2018-04-25 22:47:03', 2, '2018-04-26 05:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(855, 1263, 279, NULL, NULL, 'Problem: Malfunctioning of the target rotating assembly in PLD-III\\r\\nYesterday (1st May 2018) during the time of deposition suddenly the target rotating assembly stopped moving in between the start and end angle, rather it was rotating only in the anticlockwise direction. Because of this problem, the growth of oxide was unsuccessful. I will be really grateful if you kindly look into this matter and resolve the problem associated with this tool.\\r\\n', '2018-05-02 09:47:02', 2, '2018-05-04 04:00:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
