(883, 1263, 279, NULL, NULL, 'Problem with the transformer/Heater of PLD-III \\r\\nOn 1st June while growing the oxide @750 C, after 5 minutes the temperature started falling rapidly, and so I had to stop the process. The system is not working properly at higher temperatures, probably the problem is associated with the heater or the transformer of the system. Because of this the oxide growth @750 C was unsuccessful. As we frequently need to grow the oxides at higher temperatures (around 750 C), It would be really good for us if you kindly look into this matter and resolve the problem.', '2018-06-03 11:44:36', 2, '2018-08-06 10:17:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
