(1048, 1173, 84, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'Dear Sir,\\r\\n\\r\\nWhile doing dielectric sputter deposition of AZO which was at position 1, plasma didn\\\'t formed. So first we checked all process steps and connections, it was all correct.\\r\\nNOTE: Plasma formed at target position 2nd and 3rd.\\r\\nFollowing checked possibilities:\\r\\n1) Regulator of Target selector was loose so we opened it and found, the acrylic sheet was broken so we bind it with glue and after that again checked but plasma did not formed.\\r\\n2) After opening process chamber, found there was a small crack over the target so, keeping this as a fault we replaced  AZO target with ZnMgo but then also plasma did not formed and also reflective power was high i.e 97 Wr.', '2019-02-04 15:37:56', 2, '2019-02-06 11:55:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
