(1125, 1173, 84, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'We are facing the following problem in dielectric sputter in micro1:\\r\\n\\r\\n 1) Reflected power is high(6-9W) during a deposition for 100W with ZnO\\r\\n target. Sometimes even it flickers between the process.\\r\\n 2) Gate valve is not working correctly.\\r\\n 3) Gas pressure is not coming to 2.2e-2.\\r\\n 4) Oxygen cylinder regulator is not working correctly.\\r\\n 5) The temperature controller is not working properly. During the process\\r\\n it\\\'s value keeps on changing between 382-410 deg. (Deposition temperature\\r\\n 400deg C).\\r\\n 6) Process chamber doesn\\\'t hold overnight vacuum.\\r\\n We are not getting uniform film thickness despite of many dummy run.', '2019-10-22 14:43:15', 2, '2019-10-30 12:21:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1126, 1779, 88, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'It  has been observed that the Aluminium Thermal Evaporator  takes more than 1 hour for achieving roughing vacuum (i.e 5 e-2) . Ideally it should take 15 minutes only. Because of roughing time it takes more than four hours to complete whole process. And also during high vacuum there are lots of  fluctuations on penning gauge. Even for high vacuum it takes more than 1 hour. So please look into this matter and resolve the same.', '2019-10-22 15:32:58', 2, '2019-10-30 10:22:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1127, 558, 87, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'SUBJECT: REFLECTIVE POWER IS MORE\\r\\nDear sir,\\r\\nthe plasma asher is giving a lot of reflective power while doing process.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor example at 50 Watts, its giving 30 Watts as reflective power even after the adjusting the matching network\\r\\nPlease look into this issue ASAP', '2019-10-25 12:53:38', 2, '2019-11-06 02:42:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1128, 558, 300, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'Subject: Cryo-regenaration needs to be performed and target changing arm trouble shooting.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring target changing, the magnet which is holding the arm is disconnected while moving arm, due to which the crucible liner is falling inside the chamber.\\r\\nPlease look into it ASAP.\\r\\n', '2019-10-25 12:56:33', 2, '2019-11-08 07:48:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1130, 89, 93, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'High power RF at low pressure (~<2E-2mbar) issue.', '2019-10-30 14:35:20', 2, '2019-11-08 07:46:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
