(1260, 1173, 186, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'DIMPLER: Earlier dimpling process use to take a maximum of 45 minutes to dimple thickness from 80-90 micron to 25-micron sample with as usual 20 gm weight of the tool,Â but now even after using for fourÂ hours, dimple does not form and this over timing will affect the sample surface.Â \\r\\nNOTE: One of the Authorized user (Navneet B.) did a test run of the Si sample (90 microns) by changing the weight of the tool to 21gm and dimpling completed within 10 minutes. But here I have concern that will this work for any kind of sample or not by changing weight.Â \\r\\nI request you to look into these issues on priority and let us know how toÂ proceed further with this. \\r\\n', '2021-04-06 10:27:42', 2, '2021-04-06 05:30:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL);
