(1283, 1173, 84, 'NULL', 'NULL', '1)  After gas flow in the process chamber its gas pressure was at 3.5e-2 mbar (It suppose to be 2.2e-2) using gases (Ar:O2 = 30sccm:20sccm) (Substrate temperature - 400 deg C).\\r\\n2) When RF was set to 100 W, the reflected power(RP) initially was 10W, and then after 2 minutes RP increases near to 100W. We have switched off the RF power immediately. We waited for 15 minutes and called the EMT staff(Bhimraj Sir). He tried to troubleshoot so that deposition can be completed but it didn\\\'t work. After starting the RF power, the plasma was started flickering after 2-5 minutes. This plasma flickering did not stop even after waiting time so decided to stop the process.\\r\\n3) Temperature controller is also not working properly. It is overshooting upto 320 degC when set to 150 deg C. Every time we are going in steps for setting any temperature because of overshoot.\\r\\n', '2021-07-29 16:30:23', 2, '2021-09-06 10:14:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
