(1285, 1779, 87, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'Today, I was doing a plasma asher run for one of the users. Process parameters were as follows: Power = 40W, O2 = 30 sccm, base vacuum = 0.2 mbar, gas pressure to strike plasma = 0.1mbar, high vacuum = 3.5 x 10-4. During the process (RF generator ON condition) both RF power & reflected power was showing 0W on the RF generator, which you can see in the attached image also. I have restarted the whole system to check the problem, then also plasma has not formed & the process has not been completed. Please look into this matter on an urgent basis.', '2021-08-10 17:00:05', 2, '2021-09-06 10:08:00', 'uploads/1285.jpg', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
