(1397, 1779, 343, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'Dear Pradeep Sir,\\r\\n\\r\\nThe PDS system usually takes 15-20 minutes for a rough vacuum, i.e., 1.00 e-2. For the last two days, it is taking a complete 1 hour to reach 1.00 e-2 vaccum. I did multiple runs to check vaccum, and I did N2 purging in the load lock chamber several times, but the vaccum issue didn\\\'t resolve. Kindly look into this matter on an urgent basis.', '2023-05-25 16:37:50', 2, '2023-07-05 10:56:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
