(1399, 1676, 330, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'The load lock turbo is not venting seamlessly as before. Lot of vibration can be sensed in load lock turbo while venting. Also during load lock turbo start a shriek sound is heard. All these problems are coming after pfeiffer rotary was replaced with agilent rotary.\\r\\nAs in this system load lock turbo and rotary are interlocked, we have no idea if the rotary is working properly or not. Please check the rotary independently.  Also please expedite the pfeiffer rotary diaphragm procurement so that the original pfeiffer rotary can be connected back to the system.', '2023-06-15 12:41:08', 2, '2023-07-05 10:48:00', '', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
