(1433, 2217, 209, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'When we turn on the system and the Ar gas, the MFC initially shows a value of 5.2 sccm. However, after some time, this value decreases to 0.5 sccm. This issue was previously resolved by changing the Ar cylinder in the lab, but even with the new Ar cylinder now connected, the issue persists. Kindly look into it.', '2025-04-01 10:47:22', 2, '2025-05-06 12:43:00', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1434, 95, 336, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'CDA pressure of primary & Secondary drop down below 6bar, Due to which system turbo pump auto shutdown.After adjust the gauge it will stable for some time and again drop down to below 6bar  This issue was occurred 4-5 times in last week.', '2025-04-01 15:05:20', 2, '2025-04-29 02:43:00', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
