(1436, 1779, 300, 'NULL', 'NULL', 'We are facing a new issue with the Genius Controller handheld device of the 6 Target E-beam Evaporator system .We have observed the Genius handheld device is behaving abnormally. \\r\\n1st we observed the Genius handheld device restarting on its own.\\r\\nTo confirm what is the issue, we did one Au deposition, the system worked fine initially, but the Genius controller (handheld device) suddenly turned off in the middle of the process @80mA. No error message is displayed on the CARRERA, all parameters are ok. Kindly look into it\\r\\n', '2025-04-16 06:40:32', 2, '2025-04-29 02:39:00', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
