(1853, 1779, 300, '', '', 'Today during the baseline run, it was observed that the rotary pump was not making any operating noise. Initially, during loading, the pump created the required vacuum as expected. However, during unloading, the vacuum was not generated by the pump. I switched the rotary pump on and off 2–3 times. Each time, the starting noise was heard but it immediately stopped, although the pump remained on. As advised by Pradeep sir, I have kept the rotary pump switched off.', '2025-09-29 19:43:19', 2, '2025-10-03 17:13:00', NULL, 1, 279, 279, NULL),
