(1861, 2177, 82, '', '', 'Following are the updates for today&#039;s 4 target e beam evaporator test run\\n1. A new ti pallet was loaded for deposition\\n2. Quartz crystal life was showing as dead, hence quartz crystal was replaced with new one. \\n3. Roughing vacuum took more than half an hour to reach 6.8 e-2 \\n4. Usually Ti melts at around 55mA according to last three runs, however today even after giving more than 100mA rate was not increasing, due to new target assembly, beam is not visible from window glass so we&#039;re not able to predict whether beam is misaligned or not, hence I have stopped the deposition and sample is inside the chamber', '2025-10-06 19:05:16', 2, '2025-10-27 12:08:00', NULL, 1, 279, 279, NULL),
