(1864, 1173, 7, '', '', 'Issued reported on 18/09/2025: \\nNano RTP computer is not turning ON after switch was by mistakenly turned off from switch board. \\n\\n\\nCurrent status dated 07/10/2025: \\nAfter EMT update on tool working status test runs performed.\\nUpdate on Nano RTP dated 06/10/2025 in presence of pradeep sir:\\n1) System software dummy and test run done in admin login.\\n2) Initially a dummy run (500C_O2 900 sccm for 30 sec) was done to monitor any errors and there was no error during this run. Once it was successful, further one baseline run was carried.\\n3) One baseline run (900C_O2 900 sccm for 30 sec) was done and it was successful. \\nThickness measurement done after the runs. Tomorrow (07/10/2025) will be carried out in general login which we normally use.\\nImages attached for reference. \\n\\n900C, O2 900 sccm for 30 sec.\\nDate 	                          Sep	 Oct\\nAvg. Thickness (nm)	17.28	14.45\\n ', '2025-10-07 11:29:40', 2, '2025-10-14 10:21:00', NULL, 1, 89, 89, NULL),
(1865, 1173, 7, '', '', 'Issue reported on 07/09/2025 by User Hanif:\\nColour changed after annealing at 550C for 35s in N2 in RTP Nano lab. Earlier. It looks like samples are burnt. It could be mostly due to over heating or some oxygen contamination in N2 gas and his suspect is the over heating.\\n\\nNote: After that tool was down so no test runs were performed to check the contamination.\\n\\n', '2025-10-07 11:41:21', 2, '2025-10-13 20:03:00', NULL, 1, 89, 89, NULL),
(1866, 1173, 7, '', '', 'Issue reported on 07/09/2025 by User Hanif:\\nColour changed after annealing at 550C for 35s in N2 in RTP Nano lab. It looks like samples are burnt and according to him it could be mostly due to over heating or some oxygen contamination in N2 gas. \\nIt was suggested to do test run in N2 ambient and give the sample for XPS for contamination check as that time XPS was down and after that RTP went down.\\n\\nNote: test runs were not performmed to check contamination as RTP system went down.', '2025-10-07 11:48:56', 1, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, 4, 1173, 2527, NULL),
