(2050, 89, 343, '', '', 'PDS system dummy test runs to be performed as per email from EMT on Nov 18 2025:\\nPlease find the google docs link for updated SOP for manual operation.\\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1M8uF2rlNGRLLRVUNTnIDS8YSlVikQ0JStjobOGFu4i0/edit?usp=sharing\\n\\nThe following are the APC positions as per the last test run.\\nAPC position reference values for each run. \\nCHF3 plasma clean recipe: APC position to be kept 10%\\nSiO2 recipe: This recipe needs modification as the existing recipe is not working, high reflected power (17W) for 600W is seen.\\nThe gas flow rates to be reduced to half and APC position to be set at 80%. With this for 600W set RF, reflected power is 3-4W\\nPH3 doping (n-doping): APC position to be kept 10%\\nEMT team will be there for next 2 runs for training and dummy runs.\\nPlease discuss with @Ajit Kumar  and @Deepti Rukade  &amp; let us know your availability to carry out the test runs', '2025-11-24 17:06:26', 2, '2026-01-15 06:00:00', NULL, 4, 1779, 1779, NULL),
