(2801, 1991, 359, '', '', 'On Wednesday (24.12.25), a burning smell was reported from the reactor dry pump (iXH100) located in the BMS room, as observed by the facility personnel(Ajay Mane). EMT personnel (Vikas) was also present at the time. They immediately switched off the reactor dry pump, after which the burning smell ceased. Subsequently, the entire new ALD system was shut down, including the turbo pumps of both the reactor and load lock, the load lock roughing pump, and all gas lines. Please look into this matter as a priority', '2025-12-26 11:47:22', 2, '2026-01-07 16:56:00', 'uploads/2801.jpeg', 1, 279, 279, NULL),
