(2880, 89, 356, '', '', 'Issue raised by Kanchan to Raith engineer (Dr. Pandu) by email: \\nIITB Mumbai Voyager Serial No: 3-000-872: Recipe manager issue\\nWe are facing an issue regarding the use of Recipe manager for patterning in our voyager system. I had created and added the recipe to our structure element in our gds file, but as soon as we start the patterning or run the patterning consistency check on this file, the connection to the patterning generator is lost. When we try different gds files, which do not contain the dose details from the recipe manager, the patterning consistency check as well as patterning goes well. However, as soon as we add the recipe from the recipe manager, the patterning issue is observed with the patterning generator disconnected when we run a patterning consistency check or start patterning.\\nIt would be very helpful if you could look into this matter and resolve the issue as soon as possible.', '2025-12-31 16:37:39', 2, '2025-12-31 16:43:00', NULL, 1, 89, 89, NULL),
