(2955, 1991, 348, '', '', 'During the SS line installation, the oil pump was disconnected from the CVD system. We now need to reconnect the pump to the CVD system. During the SS line installation, the oil pump was disconnected from the CVD system. We now need to reconnect the pump to the CVD system. ', '2026-01-06 10:58:30', 2, '2026-01-07 16:34:00', NULL, 1, 279, 279, NULL),
(2956, 1991, 359, '', '', 'Facing an interlock issue in the Fiji G2 system, due to which we are unable to evacuate the H₂S line.  Below is the stepwise summary of recent activities and observations in the system. We noticed a burning smell from the chamber\\\'s dry pump. The previous day, an H₂S process was done in the chamber. We immediately switched off the dry pump for safety concerns.The system was shut down for the next two days, and later the dry pump was replaced with a nonLL ALD dry pump. After replacement, the system was turned on. When the software was opened, several errors were observed. After clearing the errors, we then started the chamber pump, and it was working normally (Chamber turbo speed was increasing). Suddenly, the \\\'Reactor Turbo Gate Interlock Failure\\\' error appeared. At the same time, \\\'Gas Panel Door is Closed\\\' error reappeared, and the LED on the gas panel interlock switch turned OFF. We tried to adjust the interlock switch to turn the LED back ON, but it did not work. We restarted the E-box, shut down the system twice, but the same error reappeared after restarting the system. ', '2026-01-06 11:06:51', 1, '2026-01-07 12:17:00', 'uploads/2956.jpeg', 1, 2457, 89, NULL),
(2957, 1903, 258, '', '', 'This is related to our Si Ge MBE system. Currently, there is no communication between the MBE system and its dedicated PC. Previously, there was communication between them. I need Mandar\\\'s help to reestablish this communication.  ', '2026-01-06 11:08:44', 2, '2026-01-08 19:21:00', NULL, 1, 89, 89, NULL),
