(3736, 89, 294, '', '', 'There is a complaint logged as per below details. Request SO to let us know on this.\\n\\nSubham Mahanti 31 Jan 2026 Complaint ID: 3724	UV-Ozone Cleaner_7.1 Lab	\\n\\nDear Sir/Madam,\\nAs far as I understand, this tool is operational but currently kept under blackout due to “no space for installation”. Since the tool is functional, I request you to kindly consider reinstalling it for usage.\\nThe Nano2 lab has an available exhaust facility suitable for the chemical wet bench, and the tool can be installed there.', '2026-02-01 18:42:11', 2, '2026-02-05 17:00:00', NULL, 4, 928, 928, 0),
(3737, 89, 354, '', '', 'There was a complaint raised by user as below: \\nRequest SO to look into this.\\nEMT has raised this issue to IT team to look into this\\n\\nMrunal Chourey 17 Jan 2026 Complaint ID: 3261	Microwriter ML 3	\\n\\nInitially (before December 2025), whenever I used to operate the Microwriter ML3 tool, if a user\\\'s slot was not activated, the machine never used to work (even a simple mouse movement/click/scroll never used to work). But I\\\'ve noticed it from mid-December; even if a user\\\'s slot is not activated (or not booked, or his/her slot is over), the tool is accessible. During my hands-on session on Friday (i.e., 16/01/2026), I was able to operate the machine even after my slot was over, and the user who was supposed to use that tool did not even activate his/her slot. Kindly look into it at your earliest. Although I\\\'ve informed Pankaj Gound about it in my previous 2 sessions, still no action has been taken', '2026-02-01 19:29:04', 2, '2026-02-03 18:00:00', NULL, 4, 928, 928, 0),
