(3903, 2276, 0, '', '', 'I am writing to respectfully bring to your attention a concern regarding the inactivity duration policy for several research tools, including the Microwriter, which currently have an inactivity period of less than 90 days.\\n\\nWe kindly request you to consider extending the inactivity duration to 90 days for such tools. In many research projects, experimental cycles, fabrication processes, and characterization runs often span more than the existing inactivity period. As a result, users may lose their authorization before completing their work or starting subsequent iterations.\\nThis leads to unnecessary delays, repetition of authorization procedures, and disruption in research continuity. Extending the inactivity duration would greatly support smooth progress and efficient utilization of resources.', '2026-02-05 14:39:21', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, 4, 2527, NULL, 0),
